    "updated_at": "2024-08-12T13:44:19Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure I understand how `abc<tab>xyz.test` is fed into the URL parser. As-is that would fail due to the lack of a base URL.\r\n\r\nBut generally what you describe is how it should work.",
