    "updated_at": "2024-08-16T15:13:12Z",
    "body": "It depends. If it also wants to act as a conformance checker that might be useful. If it's meant to parse URLs encountered on the web from `Location` headers to `<a href=\"...\">` then probably not. You'd want the best performance possible and not have to do this additional bookkeeping.",
