    "updated_at": "2024-08-17T05:50:29Z",
    "body": "@gibson042 interesting. For Safari that is a known bug that we plan on fixing in due course. Curious how Firefox ended up in that state though. It seems Firefox does some non-sanctioned escaping before parsing the URL: https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp#5750-5755. That might well be how it ends up in this state. This overall issue is tracked in https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/883.",
